<%
box = infobox.InfoBox()
box.title = 'Download Ogg Vorbis 1.0.1 Software For Unix/Linux'
box.fontsize = -1
box.title_image = '/images/NewsBox-bg.png'
box.title_image_r = '/images/NewsBox-right-bg.png'

self.write(box.start())
%>

<i>Note: If you use an rpm based distribution other than Red Hat, you can probably still use the RPMs
provided by download the SRPMS and rebuilding them (rpm --rebuild x.src.rpm)</i><br>
<br>
<i>Note to Debian users: Debian unstable is kept up to date with the latest packages you will find here.
After several days with no reported issues, these packages make their way to the testing branch.</i>

<h2>Players</h2>
<blockquote>

<b><a href="http://www.xmms.org/">XMMS</a></b> (requires libraries: <b>libogg</b>, <b>libvorbis</b>):<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<A href="http://www.xmms.org/">Download at xmms.org</A><BR>

<b><a href="http://www.zinf.org/">Zinf (formerly FreeAMP)</a></b><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.zinf.org/download.php">download Zinf</a><br>

</blockquote>

<br>

<h2>Encoders / Players / Tools</h2>
<blockquote>
These tools will allow you to play, encode and manage Ogg Vorbis files.
<br><br>

<b>Vorbis Tools</b> (requires libraries: <b>libao</b>, <b>libogg</b>, <b>libvorbis</b>)<br><br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for RedHat Linux 9:<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH9/vorbis-tools-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm">vorbis-tools-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/vorbis-tools-1.0.1-1.src.rpm">vorbis-tools-1.0.1-1.src.rpm</a><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>development packages</i><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH9/vorbis-tools-debuginfo-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm">vorbis-tools-debuginfo-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br>

<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;for RedHat Linux 8:<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH8/vorbis-tools-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm">vorbis-tools-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/vorbis-tools-1.0.1-1.src.rpm">vorbis-tools-1.0.1-1.src.rpm</a><br>

<br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for everyone:<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/vorbis-tools-1.0.1.tar.gz">vorbis-tools-1.0.1.tar.gz</a><br>

</blockquote>

<br>

<h2>Libraries</h2>
<blockquote>
These are the core libraries that make Ogg Vorbis work.  You'll need these
to use anything else.
<br><br>

<b>libao</b><br><br>
See <a href='http://www.xiph.org/ao/'>www.xiph.org/ao/</a>.
<br><br>

<b>libogg</b><br><br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for RedHat Linux 9:<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH9/libogg-1.1-1.i386.rpm">libogg-1.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/libogg-1.1-1.src.rpm">libogg-1.1-1.src.rpm</a><br><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>development packages</i><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH9/libogg-devel-1.1-1.i386.rpm">libogg-devel-1.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH9/libogg-debuginfo-1.1-1.i386.rpm">libogg-debuginfo-1.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br><br>

<br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for RedHat Linux 8:<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH8/libogg-1.1-1.i386.rpm">libogg-1.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/libogg-1.1-1.src.rpm">libogg-1.1-1.src.rpm</a><br><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>development packages</i><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH8/libogg-devel-1.1-1.i386.rpm">libogg-devel-1.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for everyone:<br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/libogg-1.1.tar.gz">libogg-1.1.tar.gz</a><br>

<br>

<b>libvorbis</b> (requires libraries: <b>libogg</b>)<br><br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for RedHat Linux 9:<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH9/libvorbis-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm">libvorbis-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/libvorbis-1.0.1-1.src.rpm">libvorbis-1.0.1-1.src.rpm</a><br><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>development packages</i><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH9/libvorbis-devel-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm">libvorbis-devel-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH9/libvorbis-debuginfo-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm">libvorbis-debuginfo-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br><br>

<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;for RedHat Linux 8:<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH8/libvorbis-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm">libvorbis-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/libvorbis-1.0.1-1.src.rpm">libvorbis-1.0.1-1.src.rpm</a><br><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>development packages</i><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/RH8/libvorbis-devel-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm">libvorbis-devel-1.0.1-1.i386.rpm</a><br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;for everyone:<br>

&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.vorbis.com/files/1.0.1/unix/libvorbis-1.0.1.tar.gz">libvorbis-1.0.1.tar.gz</a><br>

</blockquote>

